WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 39

01:27.800 --> 01:32.640
(Yangui)

01:58.650 --> 02:00.050
You go first.

03:11.370 --> 03:14.140
Baoping, how many days has it been?

03:14.210 --> 03:15.570
Your Majesty,

03:15.980 --> 03:17.700
more than three days.

03:22.460 --> 03:23.910
By now,

03:23.930 --> 03:26.560
Jin should've already met with Cui Xu.

03:26.580 --> 03:27.940
Your Majesty,

03:28.090 --> 03:30.170
General Cui is loyal and upright.

03:30.250 --> 03:31.400
Once he hears the news,

03:31.420 --> 03:33.540
he'll surely rush to protect you.

03:33.620 --> 03:36.220
Cui Xu may be loyal and upright,

03:36.810 --> 03:37.980
but he would never abandon

03:37.980 --> 03:39.880
the people at the border

03:39.900 --> 03:41.310
just to save me.

03:41.330 --> 03:43.470
He fears no authority
and is only concerned

03:43.490 --> 03:45.940
about the well-being of the people.

03:47.020 --> 03:48.420
To him,

03:48.700 --> 03:50.770
as long as the border remains secure

03:51.180 --> 03:52.840
and the people are safe,

03:52.860 --> 03:55.330
nothing else matters.

04:01.210 --> 04:02.700
What?

04:02.930 --> 04:04.640
Rongyang is rebelling?

04:04.660 --> 04:06.180
And Marquis Changxing.

04:06.300 --> 04:07.520
That's impossible.

04:07.540 --> 04:09.430
Marquis Changxing may be ambitious,

04:09.450 --> 04:10.760
but he has fought

04:10.780 --> 04:12.490
alongside His Majesty for years.

04:12.490 --> 04:13.670
Why would he rebel?

04:13.690 --> 04:15.490
Everything I said is true.

04:15.490 --> 04:18.240
Please return to Ling'an with me
to rescue His Majesty.

04:21.980 --> 04:24.400
I know that's the top priority now.

04:24.420 --> 04:25.260
However,

04:25.260 --> 04:26.720
as you've seen along the way,

04:26.740 --> 04:28.320
the border situation is dire.

04:28.340 --> 04:30.330
Longgu Pass is easy to defend
but hard to attack.

04:30.340 --> 04:31.890
The Nanwu forces launch constant raids,

04:31.890 --> 04:34.030
and our soldiers are already exhausted.

04:34.050 --> 04:35.100
If we divert

04:35.100 --> 04:36.620
any more troops

04:36.620 --> 04:37.980
to return with your Chiyu Cavalry

04:37.980 --> 04:39.550
to rescue His Majesty in Ling'an,

04:39.570 --> 04:40.870
then within three days,

04:40.890 --> 04:42.550
the border will fall,

04:42.570 --> 04:43.990
and the nation will be lost.

04:44.010 --> 04:46.300
Forgive me, but I cannot comply.

04:47.300 --> 04:49.610
(List)
These are the officials opposing you.

04:50.930 --> 04:52.760
Prince Qi is indeed helping you

04:52.780 --> 04:54.440
stabilize the old ministers.

04:54.460 --> 04:55.960
Most of them have pledged allegiance.

04:55.980 --> 04:57.660
If Prince Qi knew I had no intention

04:57.660 --> 04:59.790
of supporting him for the throne,

04:59.810 --> 05:01.600
how do you think he would react?

05:01.620 --> 05:03.010
Marquis Changxing,

05:03.220 --> 05:05.110
why has there never been

05:05.130 --> 05:07.300
a Queen in Dazhou?

05:07.570 --> 05:08.760
In my opinion,

05:08.780 --> 05:10.350
it won't be long

05:10.370 --> 05:12.570
before there is one.

05:16.010 --> 05:17.220
At first,

05:17.220 --> 05:19.350
I truly had no such ambition.

05:19.370 --> 05:22.740
Thank you for reminding me of that.

05:23.450 --> 05:26.380
However, you've never said

05:26.490 --> 05:28.260
what it is that you want.

05:28.860 --> 05:30.540
I ask for nothing,

05:30.540 --> 05:32.980
only to dedicate

05:32.980 --> 05:34.650
my life to you.

05:36.100 --> 05:37.460
Marquis, sit.

05:39.010 --> 05:40.250
Rest assured.

05:40.250 --> 05:42.500
I will not treat you unfairly.

05:43.220 --> 05:45.300
You'll have power

05:45.330 --> 05:48.620
second only to one, above all others.

05:51.100 --> 05:52.740
Thank you, Your Highness.

05:55.660 --> 05:57.010
Father is in danger.

05:57.010 --> 05:58.600
He cannot delay any longer.

05:58.870 --> 05:59.740
If the Grand Princess

05:59.740 --> 06:01.110
truly intends to kill him,

06:01.130 --> 06:02.790
the throne will change hands,

06:02.810 --> 06:05.450
and the nation will be lost too.

06:07.570 --> 06:09.230
Your Highness, please rise.

06:11.810 --> 06:13.160
Given the current situation,

06:13.180 --> 06:14.700
I have

06:14.860 --> 06:16.860
but one choice.

06:16.930 --> 06:18.820
What if I told you that the crisis

06:18.890 --> 06:20.820
at the border can be resolved?

06:21.420 --> 06:22.890
Your Highness,

06:22.930 --> 06:24.870
how do you propose to resolve it?

06:24.890 --> 06:27.530
With the help of my wife, Jiang Si.

06:27.690 --> 06:29.050
Ridiculous.

06:29.130 --> 06:30.450
How could a mere woman

06:30.450 --> 06:32.470
make an entire army retreat?

06:32.490 --> 06:34.200
You may not know

06:34.220 --> 06:36.770
that Jiang Si is the Saintess of Nanwu.

06:43.220 --> 06:44.580
Right over there.

06:48.440 --> 06:49.560
(Hunting Order)

06:49.570 --> 06:51.650
Isn't she Su Ke's daughter?

06:51.790 --> 06:53.430
How did she become
the Saintess of Nanwu?

06:53.450 --> 06:55.050
I don't know the details either,

06:55.050 --> 06:57.540
but she bears the totem of the Saintess.

06:57.540 --> 06:59.090
Nanwu has troops stationed at the border

06:59.100 --> 07:00.870
for the sole purpose of rescuing her.

07:00.890 --> 07:03.030
Now that she has returned,

07:03.050 --> 07:04.160
they have no reason

07:04.180 --> 07:05.540
to wage war again.

07:06.050 --> 07:08.650
General, please trust me this time.

07:11.050 --> 07:13.380
What do you think

07:13.570 --> 07:15.230
about my ascension to the throne?

07:15.250 --> 07:18.620
The sooner, the better.

07:18.890 --> 07:21.260
Delays bring unforeseen changes.

07:22.130 --> 07:23.530
However,

07:24.570 --> 07:26.990
someone is joining forces
with other officials

07:27.010 --> 07:28.570
to impeach me.

07:29.370 --> 07:31.160
Tell me.

07:31.180 --> 07:33.160
Should I root him out?

07:33.180 --> 07:34.540
Of course.

07:34.740 --> 07:36.400
Your Highness, you're right.

07:36.420 --> 07:37.930
The top priority now is to eliminate

07:37.930 --> 07:40.330
dissidents and uproot threats.

07:40.450 --> 07:42.770
Only then can the enthronement ceremony

07:42.790 --> 07:44.110
proceed smoothly in five days.

07:44.130 --> 07:45.770
Let's do as you say.

08:02.540 --> 08:03.880
(Mount Shenjian, Nanwu)
Jiang Si,

08:03.890 --> 08:06.700
this totem is identical
to the one on your neck.

08:14.810 --> 08:16.210
Grand Elder,

08:16.740 --> 08:17.960
long time no see.

08:17.980 --> 08:20.110
Who dares trespass upon the sacred area?

08:21.250 --> 08:24.220
Everything here is still the same.

08:26.340 --> 08:29.170
Has your old leg injury
gotten any better?

08:32.530 --> 08:34.220
We've never met before.

08:34.460 --> 08:36.150
How do you know

08:36.170 --> 08:37.530
about my leg injury?

08:45.440 --> 08:50.600
(Zhou)

08:51.170 --> 08:51.610
Chief,

08:51.630 --> 08:54.230
General Cui is avoiding us
under the pretext of military duties.

08:54.250 --> 08:55.870
The main tent has been left to us.

08:55.890 --> 08:57.880
It's obvious that he doesn't want
to go with us.

08:57.880 --> 08:58.990
What should we do, Chief?

08:59.010 --> 09:00.500
What should we do?

09:00.770 --> 09:02.130
We have to wait.

09:20.410 --> 09:21.960
His Majesty has ordered me

09:21.980 --> 09:23.620
to lead the border troops

09:23.620 --> 09:25.410
and the Chiyu Cavalry to attack Nanwu

09:25.410 --> 09:26.890
and fight to the death.

09:27.170 --> 09:30.200
We cannot return
until Nanwu is defeated.

09:30.220 --> 09:31.740
What?

09:31.770 --> 09:33.380
This is the imperial edict.

09:33.530 --> 09:36.600
If this is the Grand Princess
and Marquis Changxing's decision,

09:37.060 --> 09:38.220
don't you think that it seems

09:38.220 --> 09:39.760
much more reasonable now?

09:40.980 --> 09:43.170
Miss Jiang, Miss Jiang.

09:43.860 --> 09:45.220
This is great.

09:45.580 --> 09:46.940
I'm glad you're back.

09:49.410 --> 09:52.340
Grand Elder, she is the Saintess.

09:52.940 --> 09:54.020
The Saintess?

09:54.040 --> 09:54.830
She is the Saintess?

09:54.850 --> 09:56.320
How do you know she is the Saintess?

09:56.340 --> 09:58.340
How can you prove it?

10:07.890 --> 10:09.460
Welcome, Saintess.

10:10.130 --> 10:12.210
May Nanwu be blessed. Welcome, Saintess.

10:12.230 --> 10:13.700
The Saintess is here. Everyone, come.

10:13.700 --> 10:23.370
May Nanwu be blessed. Welcome, Saintess.

10:23.490 --> 10:26.990
May Nanwu be blessed. Welcome, Saintess.

10:27.010 --> 10:30.680
May Nanwu be blessed. Welcome, Saintess.

10:30.700 --> 10:33.290
May Nanwu be blessed. Welcome, Saintess.

10:33.290 --> 10:35.100
Grand Elder, please rise.

10:36.530 --> 10:37.890
I have come back

10:38.290 --> 10:40.230
with an important matter

10:40.250 --> 10:41.840
to discuss with you.

10:41.860 --> 10:43.600
Once this order is given,

10:43.620 --> 10:46.170
the South will be drenched in blood.

10:46.320 --> 10:46.650
Even so,

10:46.650 --> 10:48.410
will you still refuse
to rescue the Emperor?

10:48.410 --> 10:50.740
Defying an imperial edict
punishable by death.

10:50.740 --> 10:54.010
A general outside is not bound
by imperial commands.

11:06.220 --> 11:07.650
Yu Jin,

11:08.740 --> 11:12.340
is it true that Rongyang has rebelled?

11:25.980 --> 11:27.060
I know that Nanwu

11:27.060 --> 11:28.440
stationed troops at the border

11:28.460 --> 11:29.920
because I was imprisoned.

11:29.940 --> 11:30.850
But now,

11:30.860 --> 11:32.560
I have returned,

11:32.580 --> 11:34.440
so Nanwu has no reason
to start war anymore.

11:34.460 --> 11:36.040
Grand Elder, please order

11:36.060 --> 11:38.000
the withdrawal of the border forces.

11:38.170 --> 11:39.860
You've just returned to Nanwu,

11:40.130 --> 11:42.170
yet you are speaking for Dazhou.

11:42.220 --> 11:43.510
If we withdraw now,

11:43.530 --> 11:45.580
and Dazhou attacks again,

11:45.620 --> 11:47.340
Nanwu will fall

11:47.340 --> 11:48.960
into an irreversible situation.

11:48.980 --> 11:50.040
Grand Elder,

11:50.060 --> 11:51.650
I am not speaking for either side.

11:51.650 --> 11:53.510
I swear by the name of the Saintess:

11:53.530 --> 11:54.990
If Nanwu withdraws its troops,

11:55.010 --> 11:56.080
Dazhou's army will retreat

11:56.100 --> 11:58.810
within half a day.

12:04.530 --> 12:05.890
Report.

12:06.700 --> 12:07.500
Report.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.800
General, Nanwu has somehow
withdrawn all its troops.

12:09.820 --> 12:10.690
Are you sure?

12:10.700 --> 12:12.270
General, it's absolutely true.

12:12.290 --> 12:13.650
Long Dan.

12:14.290 --> 12:16.040
Go tell Mr. Zhen

12:16.060 --> 12:18.410
that we are leaving immediately.

12:18.410 --> 12:19.540
- Yes.
- Pass the order.

12:19.560 --> 12:21.620
We'll go rescue His Majesty
in Ling'an immediately.

12:21.620 --> 12:22.980
Yes.

12:24.370 --> 12:25.890
Yes, Your Highness.

12:32.620 --> 12:34.150
News from the front lines.

12:34.170 --> 12:36.560
The Dazhou forces have indeed withdrawn.

12:36.580 --> 12:37.940
Excellent.

12:38.170 --> 12:40.350
The Saintess's foresight

12:40.370 --> 12:43.010
will guide Nanwu down the right path.

12:43.410 --> 12:45.200
You will surely lead us

12:45.220 --> 12:46.620
to destroy Dazhou.

12:46.860 --> 12:48.750
Dazhou's border is unguarded now.

12:48.770 --> 12:50.980
It's the perfect time to strike.

12:51.130 --> 12:52.470
Saintess, I assume

12:52.490 --> 12:54.980
you will stay with us in Nanwu

12:55.170 --> 12:57.580
and lead us to wipe out Dazhou.

12:58.010 --> 12:59.080
Grand Elder,

12:59.100 --> 13:00.110
war will not

13:00.130 --> 13:01.860
revive Nanwu.

13:02.460 --> 13:03.750
I've seen

13:03.770 --> 13:05.080
the aftermath of war.

13:05.100 --> 13:06.470
In that vision,

13:06.490 --> 13:07.820
Nanwu used war

13:07.820 --> 13:09.180
to solve its problems

13:09.290 --> 13:10.800
and killed the Emperor of Dazhou

13:10.820 --> 13:13.010
during the Mid-Autumn Hunt.

13:13.140 --> 13:14.050
Are you saying

13:14.060 --> 13:16.650
what will happen
after the successful assassination?

13:16.980 --> 13:17.990
Yes.

13:18.010 --> 13:19.510
You've always thought

13:19.530 --> 13:20.800
that killing Emperor Jingming

13:20.820 --> 13:21.970
would solve the problem,

13:21.990 --> 13:23.580
but Dazhou will have a new Emperor.

13:23.600 --> 13:25.080
The new Emperor will be incompetent,

13:25.100 --> 13:26.610
and the Grand Princess will hold power.

13:26.620 --> 13:27.490
She'll issue a decree

13:27.490 --> 13:28.360
to annihilate Nanwu,

13:28.380 --> 13:29.940
and you'll have to send the Nightingale

13:29.940 --> 13:32.010
to Ling'an to kill the Grand Princess.

13:32.370 --> 13:35.810
We and Dazhou
can't thrive simultaneously.

13:35.860 --> 13:36.990
Nanwu

13:37.010 --> 13:39.050
has limited resources.

13:39.940 --> 13:41.920
Nanwu and Dazhou fight

13:41.940 --> 13:43.360
to develop themselves

13:43.380 --> 13:44.560
while suppressing each other.

13:44.580 --> 13:45.510
Grand Elder,

13:45.530 --> 13:46.600
I have a way

13:46.620 --> 13:48.650
to stop this senseless cycle.

13:48.740 --> 13:51.270
Please gather the clan tomorrow.

13:51.290 --> 13:52.230
I will announce

13:52.250 --> 13:54.410
the true way to revive Nanwu.

14:10.060 --> 14:11.150
Mr. Zhen, is that you?

14:11.170 --> 14:12.530
Yes.

14:14.130 --> 14:15.750
Recently, the Palace has been preparing

14:15.750 --> 14:17.590
for the ritual sacrifices
to heaven and earth,

14:17.590 --> 14:19.090
the ancestral temple, and the state.

14:19.110 --> 14:21.470
But I feel this is not as simple
as it seems.

14:21.490 --> 14:23.480
Ritual sacrifices to heaven and earth,

14:23.690 --> 14:25.680
the ancestral temple, and the state?

14:25.700 --> 14:26.750
This is bad.

14:26.770 --> 14:28.090
That's the enthronement ceremony.

14:28.090 --> 14:29.840
It's necessary to ascend to the throne.

14:29.860 --> 14:31.440
It seems the Grand Princess

14:31.770 --> 14:33.510
really plans to usurp the throne.

14:33.530 --> 14:35.100
If that's the case,

14:35.370 --> 14:37.140
all of us who oppose her

14:39.100 --> 14:40.690
won't be able to survive.

14:41.010 --> 14:41.820
What should we do?

14:41.840 --> 14:43.360
Have Jin and the troops returned yet?

14:43.370 --> 14:45.360
I'm afraid they won't make it in time.

14:47.290 --> 14:48.200
Your Highness,

14:48.220 --> 14:49.100
the stubborn officials

14:49.100 --> 14:50.870
who refused to submit

14:50.890 --> 14:52.530
have been dealt with.

14:52.620 --> 14:54.050
Only one remains.

14:55.340 --> 14:56.210
Who?

14:56.220 --> 14:58.720
It's Zhen Heng,
the first one to join forces

14:58.740 --> 15:00.200
with others against you.

15:07.370 --> 15:08.410
I almost forgot

15:08.410 --> 15:11.300
there's this stubborn hard nut to crack.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.560
(Peace and Prosperity)

15:13.580 --> 15:15.150
The Palace is dangerous now.

15:15.170 --> 15:16.340
I've found a way

15:16.340 --> 15:17.520
to send you out of the Palace.

15:17.530 --> 15:18.790
I've packed everything for you.

15:18.810 --> 15:20.400
(Sunshine and Luxury)
You leave tonight.

15:20.410 --> 15:22.350
Mother, I won't leave.

15:22.370 --> 15:24.920
Fuqing, you can't be willful now.

15:24.940 --> 15:26.050
Didn't you always say

15:26.070 --> 15:27.270
you wanted to see the world?

15:27.290 --> 15:28.410
You have the chance now.

15:28.410 --> 15:29.560
Don't you want to go?

15:29.580 --> 15:32.320
Mother, I'm not being willful.

15:32.340 --> 15:33.740
I've grown up.

15:33.760 --> 15:34.890
I'm no longer the little girl

15:34.890 --> 15:36.130
who used to cry

15:36.130 --> 15:37.500
hiding in the closet.

15:37.770 --> 15:39.630
I must stay in the Palace,

15:39.650 --> 15:41.680
so I can send messages to Mr. Zhen

15:41.700 --> 15:43.500
and protect you.

15:43.700 --> 15:45.150
No matter what you say,

15:45.170 --> 15:47.100
I will never run away on my own.

15:50.480 --> 15:55.480
(Sunshine and Luxury)

15:58.100 --> 15:59.500
- Stop.
- Stop.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.110
There are so many people.

16:01.130 --> 16:02.390
Who are you?

16:02.410 --> 16:04.800
Sir, we are a trading convoy
from the north.

16:04.820 --> 16:07.040
- Please let us through.
- From the north?

16:07.100 --> 16:08.350
I can tell from your accent

16:08.370 --> 16:09.600
that you're from the south.

16:09.620 --> 16:11.690
Sir, I wouldn't dare to joke about this.

16:12.010 --> 16:13.370
Here.

16:14.820 --> 16:16.110
Look at your calluses.

16:16.130 --> 16:17.690
You must've been a soldier.

16:18.490 --> 16:20.050
As for those behind you,

16:20.290 --> 16:22.050
none of them look like porters.

16:22.170 --> 16:24.100
Someone, investigate.

16:25.280 --> 16:28.520
(Ling'an)

16:43.220 --> 16:44.580
Stop.

16:50.370 --> 16:51.930
- Prince Qi.
- Prince Qi.

16:56.500 --> 16:57.860
What's going on?

16:57.890 --> 16:58.840
Prince Qi,

16:58.860 --> 17:00.760
I found this convoy suspicious.

17:00.780 --> 17:01.710
We've arrested them

17:01.730 --> 17:03.190
to hand over to the Grand Princess.

17:03.210 --> 17:04.650
Leave them to me.

17:05.260 --> 17:06.540
- Take them away.
- Go.

17:06.540 --> 17:07.900
Wait.

17:08.370 --> 17:10.250
Prince Qi, I...

17:10.340 --> 17:13.250
Didn't I just capture them?

17:14.970 --> 17:16.980
- Yes.
- Yes.

17:26.100 --> 17:27.460
Let them go.

17:30.840 --> 17:35.360
(Ling'an)

17:39.970 --> 17:41.910
Greetings, Saintess.

17:41.930 --> 17:46.150
Signs from heaven
can guide all to see the future.

17:46.170 --> 17:49.000
Nothing between heaven and earth

17:49.020 --> 17:50.350
is more valuable than humans.

17:50.370 --> 17:54.340
When war ends, Nanwu will thrive,
and the world will be at peace.

17:54.890 --> 17:56.610
Saintess, throughout Nanwu's history,

17:56.630 --> 17:58.080
there has only been war, never peace.

17:58.100 --> 17:59.240
That's right.

17:59.260 --> 18:00.100
The people of Nanwu

18:00.100 --> 18:01.520
are born for battle.

18:01.540 --> 18:02.700
Compared to Dazhou,

18:02.720 --> 18:04.240
Nanwu is small and sparsely populated,

18:04.260 --> 18:06.150
but every soldier is skilled in battle.

18:06.170 --> 18:07.240
We take

18:07.260 --> 18:09.040
what we need by force.

18:09.060 --> 18:10.110
It's that simple.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.280
Leader Bai,

18:11.300 --> 18:13.350
no one is born for war.

18:13.370 --> 18:15.730
People are born to live better lives.

18:15.890 --> 18:17.710
If we could live
in peace and prosperity,

18:17.730 --> 18:20.150
who would want to fight
on the battlefield?

18:20.170 --> 18:21.280
I know

18:21.300 --> 18:22.840
that Nanwu has prioritized war

18:22.860 --> 18:24.620
for the past century.

18:24.780 --> 18:27.140
This cannot be changed overnight.

18:27.170 --> 18:29.110
But since Nanwu has chosen me,

18:29.130 --> 18:30.370
made me the Saintess,

18:30.390 --> 18:32.320
and given me the ability
to foresee the future,

18:32.340 --> 18:33.960
I am willing to work with all of you

18:33.980 --> 18:35.060
to turn the beautiful future

18:35.060 --> 18:36.430
I have foreseen

18:36.450 --> 18:38.020
into reality.

18:40.300 --> 18:43.100
So, what should we do?

18:44.340 --> 18:45.480
Grand Elder,

18:45.500 --> 18:47.240
let's set one year as a trial period.

18:47.260 --> 18:48.150
In this year,

18:48.170 --> 18:49.390
I will stay in Nanwu.

18:49.410 --> 18:51.150
Without starting a single war,

18:51.170 --> 18:53.280
we will achieve
unprecedented prosperity.

18:53.300 --> 18:54.820
What if you fail?

18:55.820 --> 18:57.490
After one year,

18:57.620 --> 18:59.110
if everyone still believes

18:59.130 --> 19:01.020
that war is the best path,

19:01.100 --> 19:03.650
I will lead the charge myself.

19:08.730 --> 19:11.000
Yes, Saintess.

19:11.020 --> 19:13.780
Yes, Saintess.

20:04.170 --> 20:06.020
It's a pity, Mr. Zhen,

20:06.100 --> 20:07.390
that your loyalty

20:07.410 --> 20:09.080
cannot save you.

20:09.100 --> 20:10.730
It will only bring harm.

20:10.890 --> 20:12.450
You and those officials

20:12.450 --> 20:15.080
have gone to great lengths
to impeach me,

20:15.100 --> 20:18.300
but in the end, it was all in vain.

20:18.970 --> 20:22.080
I dared to kill the Crown Prince,

20:22.100 --> 20:25.100
let alone you officials.

20:25.730 --> 20:27.690
In my eyes,

20:28.690 --> 20:31.620
you are nothing but flies

20:31.890 --> 20:33.780
and ants.

20:35.540 --> 20:39.380
Death is nothing to be afraid of.

20:40.410 --> 20:42.410
I've seen many people like you

20:42.580 --> 20:45.450
in Capital Security.

20:45.650 --> 20:47.930
You've failed His Majesty's trust

20:49.780 --> 20:50.930
and don't deserve to be

20:50.930 --> 20:53.340
the Grand Princess of Dazhou.

20:59.930 --> 21:01.730
Zhen Heng,

21:01.780 --> 21:03.620
you're too bold.

21:04.210 --> 21:06.060
No wonder I couldn't find

21:06.060 --> 21:07.970
Earl Dongping's family.

21:08.500 --> 21:10.780
So, they're hiding here with you.

21:11.130 --> 21:12.490
Very well.

21:13.210 --> 21:15.250
I've changed my mind.

21:16.060 --> 21:17.650
I only intended to wipe out

21:17.650 --> 21:19.820
Earl Dongping's family.

21:21.020 --> 21:22.820
But now it seems

21:23.020 --> 21:26.490
your family cannot be left out.

21:26.970 --> 21:29.300
Rongyang, how dare you?

21:29.580 --> 21:32.780
Crimes will bring divine retribution.

21:32.780 --> 21:34.560
Zhen Heng has spoken out of turn

21:34.580 --> 21:35.950
and disrespected me.

21:35.970 --> 21:37.340
Seize him.

22:17.480 --> 22:22.980
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

22:23.860 --> 22:29.230
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

22:29.790 --> 22:32.900
♪ I don't wish for favors
from the heavens ♪

22:32.920 --> 22:35.940
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

22:36.150 --> 22:42.950
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

22:43.330 --> 22:48.630
♪ Fate's been written; we're its slaves ♪

22:49.620 --> 22:54.960
♪ I dare not look back
at the road I came from ♪

22:55.320 --> 22:58.280
♪ As the sun sets,
the wise seek redemption ♪

22:58.300 --> 22:59.660
In my heart,

23:00.820 --> 23:02.410
the law is the light,

23:03.210 --> 23:06.410
punishing evil, promoting good,
and dispelling shadows.

23:08.050 --> 23:14.520
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

23:14.540 --> 23:20.900
♪ Is it too difficult
to be free from sorrow ♪

23:20.920 --> 23:24.110
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

23:24.130 --> 23:27.800
♪ To be remedied ♪

23:27.820 --> 23:32.820
♪ A small greed forms
an unbreakable tie ♪

23:32.820 --> 23:33.770
Fuqing...

23:33.770 --> 23:40.250
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

23:40.860 --> 23:44.250
Fuqing. It's really Fuqing.

23:45.060 --> 23:47.520
Mr. Zhen, are you afraid of death?

23:47.540 --> 23:48.900
Yes.

23:50.970 --> 23:52.020
Because I still have many

23:52.020 --> 23:54.340
things I want to do,

23:54.890 --> 23:57.490
things I want to say,

23:58.300 --> 23:59.660
and

24:02.210 --> 24:03.620
people I want to see.

24:08.450 --> 24:09.810
Princess Fuqing,

24:11.020 --> 24:13.130
if there's still a chance,

24:14.260 --> 24:15.480
I'll take you

24:15.500 --> 24:17.100
to the southern city's dam,

24:17.890 --> 24:19.550
and we'll fly kites together.

24:25.620 --> 24:26.750
Sure.

24:26.770 --> 24:29.770
♪ Is the resting shore ♪

24:30.170 --> 24:31.620
If in the next life,

24:32.820 --> 24:34.540
we can meet again,

24:36.970 --> 24:38.330
Fuqing...

24:38.960 --> 24:41.800
♪ The wildflowers bloom
across the mountains ♪

24:41.820 --> 24:43.620
I will never fail you.

24:45.860 --> 24:47.650
I will never fail you.

24:47.820 --> 24:51.700
♪ A tragic ending ♪

24:51.720 --> 24:54.140
♪ A shared bond ♪

24:54.140 --> 25:00.490
♪ A tragic ending ♪

25:12.780 --> 25:14.190
Why did you come to my house?

25:14.210 --> 25:16.170
You should ask Prince Qi.

25:17.210 --> 25:18.680
Rest assured, everyone.

25:18.970 --> 25:21.060
This is the safest place for now.

25:23.280 --> 25:24.330
After Mr. Zhen was captured

25:24.330 --> 25:25.630
by the Grand Princess,

25:25.650 --> 25:27.190
Earl Dongping's family was found,

25:27.210 --> 25:28.620
and they are now imprisoned.

25:28.640 --> 25:29.580
When Mr. Zhen was told

25:29.580 --> 25:30.950
you were returning to Ling'an,

25:30.970 --> 25:32.330
he came to see me.

25:32.860 --> 25:34.430
How dare you speculate about this?

25:34.450 --> 25:35.950
I know very well

25:35.970 --> 25:36.970
that you're not

25:36.970 --> 25:38.240
someone heartless.

25:38.260 --> 25:39.950
What you have done

25:39.970 --> 25:42.000
is to win His Majesty's trust,

25:42.020 --> 25:43.670
to display your talents,

25:43.690 --> 25:45.240
and to seek the prosperity of Dazhou.

25:45.260 --> 25:46.760
All of these actions

25:46.780 --> 25:48.340
are justifiable.

25:48.580 --> 25:50.060
In my view,

25:50.410 --> 25:51.860
this moment is

25:52.170 --> 25:55.410
the perfect opportunity
to fulfill your ambitions.

25:55.500 --> 25:57.930
Instead of rebelling
with the Grand Princess,

25:58.580 --> 26:01.930
you should stabilize her for us now.

26:02.060 --> 26:03.420
I know

26:03.580 --> 26:05.780
the Grand Princess will never let me go,

26:06.060 --> 26:07.520
so first,

26:07.540 --> 26:09.080
Prince Qi,

26:09.100 --> 26:10.950
please protect yourself.

26:10.970 --> 26:11.870
Later,

26:11.890 --> 26:14.450
when I'm unable to do anything,

26:16.210 --> 26:19.430
Prince Qi, please

26:19.450 --> 26:22.970
help the 7th Prince.

26:33.020 --> 26:34.560
Why are you so certain

26:34.580 --> 26:36.620
that I won't tell the Grand Princess

26:37.370 --> 26:39.020
about what happened tonight?

26:43.580 --> 26:45.560
That day in the hall,

26:45.580 --> 26:48.490
you were there, and so was I.

26:49.690 --> 26:51.580
Since I dared to come today,

26:51.890 --> 26:53.860
it means I believe that you

26:54.450 --> 26:56.380
have made your decision.

27:00.450 --> 27:01.810
Thank you, Zhang.

27:02.860 --> 27:04.190
Our time is limited.

27:04.210 --> 27:05.910
Tomorrow is the enthronement ceremony.

27:05.930 --> 27:07.570
We must stop the Grand Princess

27:07.590 --> 27:08.830
and rescue Father before that.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.870
I've made some inquiries.

27:09.890 --> 27:11.570
The Palace is filled with Speed Guards,

27:11.590 --> 27:13.800
and outside are the troops
of Marquis Changxing.

27:13.820 --> 27:16.580
So, our top priority is to find a way

27:17.580 --> 27:19.670
to defeat a larger force
with a smaller one.

27:19.690 --> 27:21.820
What if we turn our people

27:21.890 --> 27:23.480
into Speed Guards?

27:23.500 --> 27:24.430
Are you saying

27:24.450 --> 27:26.260
we can find an equal number
of Speed Guards

27:26.260 --> 27:27.340
to match the Chiyu Cavalry,

27:27.340 --> 27:28.540
- and replace them?
- Yes.

27:28.540 --> 27:29.400
Good idea.

27:29.410 --> 27:31.050
The Palace guards are fixed in number.

27:31.070 --> 27:32.240
With two forces in an attack,

27:32.240 --> 27:33.430
we'll seize the high ground.

27:33.450 --> 27:34.630
Once we control the heights,

27:34.650 --> 27:35.870
the ground will be clear.

27:35.890 --> 27:37.300
But that's not enough.

27:37.650 --> 27:40.080
We need someone
to balance Marquis Changxing,

27:40.100 --> 27:41.660
or he'll come back at us.

27:42.690 --> 27:44.210
I'm willing to do that.

27:50.360 --> 27:53.000
(Virtues Run Far)

27:53.020 --> 27:54.520
Enter through the secret passage.

27:54.540 --> 27:56.000
Split into three groups.

27:56.020 --> 27:57.950
The passage is complex and winding.

27:58.060 --> 27:59.100
Act with caution.

27:59.120 --> 28:00.960
(Map of Secret Passages)

28:07.860 --> 28:09.090
Captain Xie, Leng Ying,

28:09.110 --> 28:09.990
you two are in charge

28:10.010 --> 28:11.500
of the watchtower outside the Palace.

28:11.500 --> 28:12.860
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:23.450 --> 28:24.560
Jiang, Long Dan,

28:24.580 --> 28:25.270
you are in charge

28:25.290 --> 28:26.760
of the watchtower inside the Palace.

28:26.780 --> 28:28.140
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:35.690 --> 28:36.760
For the final step,

28:36.780 --> 28:37.870
you must work together

28:37.890 --> 28:39.860
to replace all the Speed Guards.

28:39.930 --> 28:41.940
- Drag the bodies.
- Drag the bodies.

29:04.820 --> 29:06.180
Let's go.

29:12.100 --> 29:13.460
Let's go.

29:40.060 --> 29:41.700
Your Majesty, you're here.

29:42.890 --> 29:44.430
What's so hard

29:44.450 --> 29:46.380
about writing an imperial edict?

29:46.540 --> 29:49.300
Look, even if you don't write it,

29:50.020 --> 29:52.730
I can still sit here.

29:53.300 --> 29:54.430
Come on.

29:54.450 --> 29:56.410
Give His Majesty a seat.

30:01.340 --> 30:03.490
Why? You don't want to sit?

30:06.210 --> 30:07.690
Bring them here.

30:15.410 --> 30:16.320
Father.

30:16.340 --> 30:17.200
Your Majesty.

30:17.210 --> 30:18.150
Your Majesty.

30:18.170 --> 30:19.350
- Father.
- Your Majesty.

30:19.370 --> 30:22.110
Rongyang, what are you doing?

30:22.130 --> 30:24.710
Look, everyone's here.

30:24.730 --> 30:26.170
I have no choice but to ask

30:26.170 --> 30:28.690
these people you care about
to persuade you.

30:29.210 --> 30:30.170
You wouldn't want

30:30.170 --> 30:32.300
to watch them die

30:32.970 --> 30:34.620
right in front of you

30:34.780 --> 30:36.930
for an imperial edict, right?

30:37.210 --> 30:38.570
Rongyang,

30:38.690 --> 30:39.620
how can you

30:39.620 --> 30:41.000
be so ruthless?

30:41.020 --> 30:44.020
It's not too late
for you to realize that.

30:45.650 --> 30:46.910
Come on.

30:46.930 --> 30:48.290
Bring the incense.

30:51.130 --> 30:53.970
One stick per person.

30:54.930 --> 30:56.950
When the incense burns out,

30:56.970 --> 30:58.620
one of them will die.

30:59.130 --> 31:02.540
If you haven't made your choice by then,

31:02.890 --> 31:05.410
I will do it for you.

31:26.620 --> 31:27.980
Switch positions.

31:36.320 --> 31:38.000
(Zhou)

32:02.580 --> 32:03.940
Zhang,

32:04.260 --> 32:05.520
take me to the inner hall

32:05.540 --> 32:06.900
to meet with Aunt.

32:07.190 --> 32:08.720
What reason is there

32:08.820 --> 32:10.540
to ensure the Grand Princess

32:10.640 --> 32:12.120
will meet with me?

32:18.210 --> 32:20.210
This is the Imperial Seal,

32:20.890 --> 32:23.080
which His Majesty asked me
in times of crisis

32:23.100 --> 32:26.040
to hand over to you.

32:26.170 --> 32:29.290
Please keep it well, Your Highness.

32:32.370 --> 32:33.730
Your Majesty,

32:33.890 --> 32:35.540
the time has come.

32:36.020 --> 32:38.020
Have you made your choice?

32:39.730 --> 32:41.140
Now,

32:42.170 --> 32:44.020
let me do it for you.

33:05.410 --> 33:07.540
Father... Father...

33:08.300 --> 33:10.060
Your Highness!

33:10.410 --> 33:11.970
Your Highness!

33:17.620 --> 33:19.340
Your Highness!

33:28.970 --> 33:30.330
Your Majesty,

33:31.370 --> 33:33.540
the second incense stick has started.

33:43.370 --> 33:44.730
Let them go.

34:09.020 --> 34:12.940
You still can't make up your mind?

34:13.500 --> 34:15.250
In this life,

34:15.940 --> 34:18.040
only I would risk my life

34:18.060 --> 34:20.020
to save you.

34:20.690 --> 34:23.420
Are you waiting for Yu Jin to save you?

34:24.690 --> 34:27.100
Yu Jin is now in a dilemma.

34:27.210 --> 34:28.400
Even if he comes,

34:28.420 --> 34:30.420
it's a dead end.

34:30.580 --> 34:32.290
Moreover,

34:32.980 --> 34:34.290
he hates you even more

34:34.290 --> 34:36.060
than I do.

34:44.210 --> 34:45.530
- What's wrong?
- Marquis,

34:45.550 --> 34:47.400
someone has replaced
our guards at the tower.

34:47.420 --> 34:49.110
The enemy has infiltrated
into the Palace.

34:49.110 --> 34:50.190
What?

34:50.290 --> 34:52.250
These useless fools.

34:52.540 --> 34:53.540
You guys stay.

34:53.540 --> 34:54.440
The rest, listen up.

34:54.460 --> 34:55.330
Go save the Emperor.

34:55.330 --> 34:56.690
Yes.

35:05.900 --> 35:07.230
Escort me

35:07.250 --> 35:08.120
out of the Palace.

35:08.130 --> 35:09.490
Yes.

35:20.210 --> 35:21.850
It's you.

35:21.850 --> 35:23.210
Marquis Changxing,

35:23.440 --> 35:24.500
if the Grand Princess knows

35:24.500 --> 35:25.600
that you abandoned her

35:25.620 --> 35:27.310
when things went wrong,

35:27.330 --> 35:28.940
she'll be very disappointed.

35:32.250 --> 35:33.750
Jiang, you brat.

35:33.770 --> 35:35.670
How dare you touch me?

35:35.690 --> 35:37.190
Do you want to die?

35:37.210 --> 35:39.030
The one who wants to die is you.

35:39.290 --> 35:41.900
Plotting against the Emperor
is punishable by death.

35:53.250 --> 35:54.190
Come.

35:54.210 --> 35:55.690
Seize him.

36:01.540 --> 36:02.910
Hand over the Tiger Tally,

36:02.930 --> 36:05.040
or you'll be executed on the spot.

36:13.980 --> 36:16.030
Tell the Grand Princess

36:16.380 --> 36:18.090
that I seek an audience.

36:24.900 --> 36:26.100
Your Majesty, you must've

36:26.100 --> 36:28.320
been used to being an Emperor.

36:28.420 --> 36:31.250
You're so calm in times of crisis.

36:31.420 --> 36:33.980
This is something I should

36:33.980 --> 36:35.770
learn from you.

36:36.580 --> 36:37.940
Shijiu.

36:41.580 --> 36:43.850
Come at me. Come at me.

36:43.850 --> 36:45.480
You are family.

36:45.500 --> 36:48.400
Why harm each other?

36:48.420 --> 36:51.080
Give me a chance to swear loyalty!

36:51.100 --> 36:52.270
Your Majesty.

36:52.290 --> 36:57.020
In my next life, I will still serve you.

36:57.690 --> 37:00.440
Who do you think you are?

37:00.460 --> 37:02.100
Do you think you deserve it?

37:02.210 --> 37:03.620
Prince Qi is here.

37:07.100 --> 37:08.540
Shijiu.

37:08.690 --> 37:10.270
I'm tired.

37:10.290 --> 37:12.100
You go tell him

37:12.620 --> 37:15.500
to report to me tomorrow.

37:16.900 --> 37:17.880
Aunt,

37:17.900 --> 37:19.620
I've found the Imperial Seal.

37:25.580 --> 37:27.020
Tell him to come in.

37:42.330 --> 37:44.540
Greetings, Your Highness.

37:46.850 --> 37:49.980
Everyone is here tonight.

37:52.020 --> 37:54.730
Bring me the seal.

37:59.380 --> 38:00.740
Yes.

38:57.770 --> 38:59.130
Your Highness.

39:00.290 --> 39:01.770
Yu Jin,

39:02.460 --> 39:03.980
do you really think

39:04.170 --> 39:06.000
this can reverse the situation?

39:06.020 --> 39:08.540
How ridiculous.

39:08.730 --> 39:09.960
My people have surrounded

39:09.980 --> 39:11.770
the Palace.

39:12.170 --> 39:14.440
None of you will leave alive.

39:14.460 --> 39:15.820
Guards!

39:23.130 --> 39:25.150
Look, they are all mine.

39:25.170 --> 39:27.360
Yu Jin, you're done for.

39:27.380 --> 39:28.740
Is that so?

39:32.580 --> 39:33.940
Aunt,

39:34.690 --> 39:36.250
look over there.

40:02.580 --> 40:04.980
Sorry for being late.
I should be punished.

40:05.210 --> 40:06.360
Cui, please rise.

40:06.380 --> 40:07.840
Thank you, Your Majesty.

40:10.770 --> 40:11.750
Let her go.

40:11.770 --> 40:13.410
- Father, no.
- Let her go.

40:18.580 --> 40:19.940
Rongyang,

40:20.420 --> 40:22.940
out of our sibling bond,

40:23.540 --> 40:25.810
I'll give you one more chance.

40:26.290 --> 40:28.440
If you plead guilty now,

40:28.460 --> 40:29.820
it's not too late.

40:29.890 --> 40:31.940
I can spare your life.

40:38.770 --> 40:40.650
Your Majesty, you're right.

40:42.580 --> 40:44.420
It's not too late.

40:45.210 --> 40:46.940
It's not the end yet.

40:49.060 --> 40:50.690
Marquis Changxing

40:51.980 --> 40:53.810
will surely come to rescue me.

40:54.060 --> 40:55.110
Your Majesty,

40:55.130 --> 40:56.880
Marquis Changxing has been captured.

40:56.900 --> 40:58.360
The Tiger Tally is here.

41:43.770 --> 41:45.940
All my schemes have failed.

41:48.770 --> 41:51.650
Your Majesty, you've defeated me.

41:53.580 --> 41:55.900
I am not someone

41:56.210 --> 41:58.500
who cowers and begs.

42:01.330 --> 42:03.290
But no one in this world

42:06.460 --> 42:09.420
has ever understood me

42:14.690 --> 42:16.140
or loved me.

42:21.020 --> 42:23.500
But I haven't lost.

42:25.460 --> 42:26.710
From now on,

42:26.730 --> 42:29.640
you'll never forget me.

42:32.330 --> 42:33.690
Father.

42:40.000 --> 42:44.400
(The End of Episode 39)

42:44.811 --> 42:46.541
♪ From place to place ♪

42:46.541 --> 42:51.481
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:51.851 --> 42:54.231
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

42:54.231 --> 42:58.461
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

42:59.171 --> 43:01.571
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:01.591 --> 43:05.251
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:05.271 --> 43:08.691
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:08.841 --> 43:14.361
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:15.181 --> 43:18.861
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:18.861 --> 43:22.941
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:23.181 --> 43:24.921
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:24.941 --> 43:29.641
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:29.641 --> 43:33.211
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:33.231 --> 43:37.461
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:37.481 --> 43:39.261
♪ Time glows ♪

43:39.261 --> 43:43.801
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:43.821 --> 43:48.621
♪ And stars ♪

43:52.851 --> 43:55.381
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

43:55.401 --> 43:59.021
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

43:59.041 --> 44:02.471
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:02.491 --> 44:07.111
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:07.111 --> 44:10.801
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:10.821 --> 44:14.911
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:15.021 --> 44:16.841
♪ Time glows ♪

44:16.841 --> 44:21.391
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:21.411 --> 44:25.111
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:25.131 --> 44:29.291
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:29.471 --> 44:31.231
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:31.231 --> 44:35.751
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:35.751 --> 44:39.391
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:39.411 --> 44:45.081
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

